or Monday, June 30\n- Client demo for the new features on July 5\n- Code freeze for the next release on July 10\n\n**Key Decisions Made:**\n- Approved the timeline extension for the payment integration\n- Selected the new dashboard design concept for implementation\n\nPlease review the attached files for detailed information. Let me know if you have any questions or need additional details.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]"}, "outputs": {"status": "drafted", "to": ["team@example.com"], "subject": "Project Status Update - Week of June 23, 2026"}, "session_index": 3, "session_type": "trigger"}, {"timestamp": "2026-06-23 09:52:24.125453+00:00", "tool_name": "EmailTool", "operation": "send_email", "inputs": {"to": ["team@example.com"], "subject": "Project Status Update - Week of June 23, 2026", "body": "Team,\n\nHere's a summary of this week's project updates:\n\n**Completed This Week:**\n- Finalized Phase 1 deliverables and submitted to stakeholders for review\n- Completed code review for the authentication module\n- Resolved 12 outstanding tickets from the backlog\n- Updated project documentation to reflect current sprint progress\n\n**In Progress:**\n- Testing the new API integration with the payment gateway\n- Preparing the Q3 roadmap presentation\n- Coordinating with the design team on the new dashboard components\n\n**Upcoming:**\n- Sprint planning meeting scheduled for Monday, June 30\n- Client demo for the new features on July 5\n- Code freeze for the next release on July 10\n\n**Key Decisions Made:**\n- Approved the timeline extension for the payment integration\n- Selected the new dashboard design concept for implementation\n\nPlease review the attached files for detailed information. Let me know if you have any questions or need additional details.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]"}, "outputs": {"status": "sent", "to": ["team@example.com"], "subject": "Project Status Update - Week of June 23, 2026"}, "session_index": 3, "session_type": "trigger"}, {"timestamp": "20